{"id":"vollie-sanders","n":"Vollie Sanders","photo":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/images/headshots/bio_vollie_sanders.jpg","bio":"Vollie Sanders has served as National Director of The Navigators' Women's Ministries equipping women to know Christ and to make Him known. Currently, she serves in a similar role with the Traveling Teams conducting one-day seminars in local churches designed to help women develop disciple-making relationships. Vollie and her husband Darrell have three children and five grandchildren.","queue":["29219","29454","29456","27155","29397","29657"],"talks":{"29219":{"t":"A Woman's Touch","sp":"vollie-sanders","tp":["Women","Ministry"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/R243.mp3","lk":5},"29454":{"t":"Grace of Partnership, The","sp":"vollie-sanders","tp":["Grace","Leadership"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/S117.mp3","lk":0},"29456":{"t":"Lifetime Partnering","sp":"vollie-sanders","tp":["Leadership","Christian Living"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/S120.mp3","lk":0},"27155":{"t":"Navigator Women Relating to One Another","sp":"vollie-sanders","tp":["Navigators","Women"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/M442.mp3","lk":0},"29397":{"t":"Surrender to Joy","sp":"vollie-sanders","tp":["Joy","Surrender"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/R961.mp3","lk":1},"29657":{"t":"Testimony","sp":"vollie-sanders","tp":["Women","Testimony"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/T0143.mp3","lk":4}}}